            "eyebrow": "The visit begins · 09:42",
            "title": "Sarah is next in the queue",
            "body": "Sarah Nakato, 34, has waited 8 minutes. The records officer has already opened her visit. She looks tired but is walking and talking normally.",
            "quote": "“I’ve had fever for three days, doctor. My head is paining me and my whole body is weak.”",
            "teach": {
              "label": "Before you touch the keyboard",
              "text": "Fever for three days is the headline — but the job in the first 30 seconds is to decide how sick she is. Let the vitals and a quick look answer that before you anchor on a diagnosis."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "decision",
          "chart": {
            "tag": "VITALS",
            "sections": [
              {
                "type": "vitals",
